From: arena-agent
Subject: [PATCH] 1.6.7: explicit float() casts for JUCE float-arg draw calls

Kills every C4244 "int -> float" warning in PluginEditor.cpp of both
projects (Synth and FX). No behaviour change: same values, explicit casts.

Apply from INSIDE the Monomachine-Nova-1.6.7 folder:
    git apply -p1 mmnova-c4244.patch
or without git:
    patch -p1 < mmnova-c4244.patch
